Scope clarification (protocol-specific)
---------------------------------------
1. This license governs the PROTOCOL TEXT — the specification, examples,
   schema, and documentation of the Wangyi Protocol as published in this
   repository.
2. An INDEPENDENT IMPLEMENTATION of the protocol (audit scripts, toolchains,
   rule profiles such as the EMF Profile) is a separate work. Implementors
   may license their own implementations under terms of their choosing,
   provided that conformance claims follow §8 of spec/wangyi_spec.md
   (citing version + attaching the verdict snapshot).
3. Verdict snapshots and audit statistics derived from third-party corpora
   are factual data; their provenance and non-redistribution notes are
